#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:39
#: ee82297a794346fcbd9ba95cae3842d5
msgid ""
"Both Pico and Meta Quest support **WebXR (Vuer)** and **XRoboToolkit** "
"backends. Launch from **fa-py-libraries** (`./init.sh all` first). There "
"is no `./run.sh vr --mode` flag."
msgstr ""
"Pico 和 Meta Quest 都支持 **WebXR (Vuer)** 和 **XRoboToolkit** 后端。从 **fa-py-"
"libraries** 启动（先 `./init.sh all`）。没有 `./run.sh vr --mode` 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:41
#: a79996fa2cff4a79886b7d0da3c22cc9
msgid "Web Mode (WebXR/Vuer)"
msgstr "Web 模式（WebXR/Vuer）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:43
#: adbc1de1187b41378a00a1d031a7388d
msgid ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr"
msgstr ""
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./run.sh vr"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:48
#: 2ff078639bf3491e833abbaab85e96c4
msgid "Opens a WebXR session accessible from the VR headset browser."
msgstr "打开可从 VR 头显浏览器访问的 WebXR 会话。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:50
#: cf125fa432ef4aee94d14589c61366ed
msgid "XRoboToolkit Mode"
msgstr "XRoboToolkit 模式"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:52
#: dfc01035deb14236b410e8fed3cde954
msgid "Native application — lower latency, recommended for production:"
msgstr "原生应用——延迟更低，建议用于生产环境："

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:54
#: bbef42c1b6bb4ac3a9e9965cb5a103ca
msgid ""
"./init.sh install-xrobotoolkit-pc-service\n"
"./init.sh install-xrobotoolkit\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt-service\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt"
msgstr ""
"./init.sh install-xrobotoolkit-pc-service\n"
"./init.sh install-xrobotoolkit\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt-service\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:61
#: 7db04565ea154cc0b453eed2900dce49
msgid ""
"Requires the **edition-matching** XRoboToolkit App on the headset "
"(Enterprise ≠ consumer Pico App). `./run.sh vr-xrt-service stop` shuts "
"down the PC Service."
msgstr ""
"需要在头显上安装**与版本匹配**的 XRoboToolkit App（企业版 ≠ 消费版 Pico App）。`./run.sh vr-xrt-"
"service stop` 关闭 PC Service。"

